{"id":"de8df30671642cb0","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-grothendieck-pretopology.md","title":"Definition — Grothendieck Pretopology","display":"Definition — Grothendieck Pretopology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-grothendieck-pretopology","aliases":["14-df-grothendieck-pretopology"],"display":"Definition — Grothendieck Pretopology","depends_on":["[[14-df-small-category]]","[[14-df-isomorphism]]","[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","[[14-df-sieve]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-grothendieck-pretopology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-grothendieck-pretopology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Grothendieck Pretopology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"898681611f432286\" href=\"?note=898681611f432286\" title=\"14-df-small-category\">14-df-small-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"199dc3cf97e92fa1\" href=\"?note=199dc3cf97e92fa1\" title=\"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers\">14-df-pullbacks-equalizers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" href=\"?note=74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" title=\"14-df-sieve\">14-df-sieve</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是有拉回的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 为赋值，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(C)\">\\(K(C)\\)</span> 的元素是射入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的箭头子集；对子集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:D\\to C\">\\(f:D\\to C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P_u,q_u,p_u)\">\\((P_u,q_u,p_u)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的拉回，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_u:P_u\\to D\">\\(p_u:P_u\\to D\\)</span>。所有带索引的族均属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsPretopology}(K,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ K(C)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\ (\\mathrm{IsIso}(u)\\to\\{u\\}\\in K(C))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in K(C)\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\ \\forall(P_u,q_u,p_u)_{u\\in S}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10mm}\\left(\\forall u\\in S\\ \\mathrm{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal C}(P_u,q_u,p_u,u,f)\\to\\{p_u\\mid u\\in S\\}\\in K(D)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in K(C)\\ \\forall(T_u)_{u\\in S}\\in\\prod_{u\\in S}K(\\mathrm{dom}(u))\\\n\\{u\\circ v\\mid u\\in S\\land v\\in T_u\\}\\in K(C).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsPretopology}(K,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ K(C)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\ (\\mathrm{IsIso}(u)\\to\\{u\\}\\in K(C))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in K(C)\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\ \\forall(P_u,q_u,p_u)_{u\\in S}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10mm}\\left(\\forall u\\in S\\ \\mathrm{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal C}(P_u,q_u,p_u,u,f)\\to\\{p_u\\mid u\\in S\\}\\in K(D)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in K(C)\\ \\forall(T_u)_{u\\in S}\\in\\prod_{u\\in S}K(\\mathrm{dom}(u))\\\n\\{u\\circ v\\mid u\\in S\\land v\\in T_u\\}\\in K(C).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.2 Grothendieck Topologies，印刷页 109–115 的基/覆盖族描述。这里采用有拉回时的前拓扑形式：同构覆盖、拉回稳定、覆盖的复合仍覆盖。覆盖族按箭头集合记录，重复箭头不改变粘合条件；空族只有在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 明确包含它时才覆盖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-small-category","status":"resolved","id":"898681611f432286","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers","status":"resolved","id":"199dc3cf97e92fa1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K(C)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"f:D\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"(P_u,q_u,p_u)","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"p_u:P_u\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsPretopology}(K,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ K(C)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\ (\\mathrm{IsIso}(u)\\to\\{u\\}\\in K(C))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in K(C)\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\ \\forall(P_u,q_u,p_u)_{u\\in S}\\\\\n&\\hspace{10mm}\\left(\\forall u\\in S\\ \\mathrm{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal C}(P_u,q_u,p_u,u,f)\\to\\{p_u\\mid u\\in S\\}\\in K(D)\\right)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in K(C)\\ \\forall(T_u)_{u\\in S}\\in\\prod_{u\\in S}K(\\mathrm{dom}(u))\\\n\\{u\\circ v\\mid u\\in S\\land v\\in T_u\\}\\in K(C).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"K","display":false}],"bytes":1869,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-pretopology|Definition — Grothendieck Pretopology]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-pretopology]]"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-pretopology]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-pretopology]]"},{"id":"080e5a6c2d99d959","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 是有拉回的小范畴，$K$ 满足 [[14-df-grothendieck-pretopology]] 的前拓扑公理。$C$ 是对象，$S$ 是 $C$ 上的筛。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-pretopology|Definition — Grothendieck Pretopology]]"}],"outgoing":["898681611f432286","d5f547b903550705","199dc3cf97e92fa1","74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5"]}